## 4. Project Structure

Use the **src layout** for all La-Z-Boy Python packages:

```
my-service/
├── pyproject.toml
├── src/
│   └── lazboy_myservice/
│       ├── __init__.py
│       ├── models.py
│       ├── service.py
│       ├── exceptions.py
│       └── config.py
└── tests/
    ├── conftest.py
    └── test_service.py
```

### Module organization order

```python
"""Module docstring — one sentence describing purpose."""

__all__ = ["ProductService", "ProductRequest"]  # defines public API

import asyncio                         # stdlib
from dataclasses import dataclass

import httpx                           # third-party
from pydantic import BaseModel

from lazboy_myservice.exceptions import ExternalServiceError  # local

MAX_RETRIES = 3                        # constants
```

